12T18:41:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"novita-app-foto-ios-27-cosa-cambia\",\"title\":\"Novità nell’app Foto di iOS 27: cosa cambia\",\"excerpt\":\"Panoramica delle principali novità dell’app Foto in iOS 27, con focus su aggiornamenti dell’esperienza d’uso e gestione dei contenuti.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Whats-New-in-the-iOS-27-Photos-App-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Whats-New-in-the-iOS-27-Photos-App-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15385,\"date\":\"2026-06-09T13:06:10+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-09T11:06:10+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-espande-visual-intelligence-split-conto-insight-nutrizionali-visionos\",\"title\":\"Apple potenzia Visual Intelligence: split del conto, insight nutrizionali e supporto a visionOS\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi aggiornamenti a Visual Intelligence: una modalità Siri nella Camera per riconoscere oggetti e suggerire azioni, con funzioni come split del conto e insight nutrizionali. La tecnologia arriva anche su visionOS.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/siri-mode-in-camera-768x430.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"siri-mode-in-camera\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15381,\"date\":\"2026-06-09T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-09T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-creazione-linguaggio-naturale-shortcuts\",\"title\":\"Apple porta la creazione in linguaggio naturale su Shortcuts\",\"excerpt\":\"Con un aggiornamento di Shortcuts, gli utenti potranno descrivere un’automazione in inglese e Apple Intelligence la costruirà in background, senza passaggi manuali.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/shortcuts-ios-27-768x430.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"shortcuts-ios-27\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15253,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:38+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-apple-tv-4k-homepod-mini-quasi-pronti-siri-aggiornata-attesa\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini “quasi pronti”: Siri aggiornata attesa\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini sarebbero pronti da mesi, ma il lancio slitterebbe finché non arriva Siri più personalizzata.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15249,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T09:30:14+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:19+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-28-piu-significativo-di-ios-27-rumor-gurman\",\"title\":\"iOS 28 sarà “più significativo” di iOS 27: il rumor di Gurman\",\"excerpt\":\"Mark Gurman parla di iOS 28 come di un aggiornamento “far more significant” rispetto a iOS 27, senza però entrare nei dettagli. iOS 28 sarebbe incentrato su un nuovo iPhone.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Low-Angle-iPhone-Purple-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Low-Angle-iPhone-Purple\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15238,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T18:30:33+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-29T23:25:50+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-ai-on-device-wwdc-2026-privacy-costi\",\"title\":\"Apple punta sull’AI on-device a WWDC 2026: focus su privacy e costi\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un report, Apple userà WWDC 2026 per spingere l’AI eseguita localmente sui dispositivi, con modelli distillati e parte dell’elaborazione in cloud.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Silicon-AI-Optimized-Feature-Siri-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Silicon-AI-Optimized-Feature-Siri\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15212,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T09:30:39+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-29T23:23:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"duckduckgo-cresce-richiesta-no-ai-dopo-update-google\",\"title\":\"DuckDuckGo: cresce la richiesta della ricerca “No AI” dopo l’update di Google\",\"excerpt\":\"DuckDuckGo segnala un aumento oltre il triplo delle visite alla pagina “No AI” dopo le novità annunciate da Google all’I/O del 19 maggio.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/duckduckgo-no-ai-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"duckduckgo-no-ai\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15128,\"date\":\"2026-05-25T11:30:27+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-25T06:35:19+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-nuove-funzioni-salute-watch-face-satelliti-rumor\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27: nuove funzioni tra salute, watch face e satelliti (rumor)\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor su watchOS 27: miglioramenti al tracciamento della frequenza cardiaca, nuove watch face e possibili funzioni satellitari. Focus anche su stabilità e performance.\",\"categoryName\":\"Watch\",\"categorySlug\":\"watch\",\"categoryId\":186,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15126,\"date\":\"2026-05-25T09:30:17+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-25T06:34:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-rumor-menu-airpods-siri-opzioni-airplay\",\"title\":\"iOS 27, i rumor su menu AirPods, Siri e opzioni AirPlay\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi rumor su iOS 27: menu impostazioni AirPods riorganizzato, miglioramenti a Genmoji e Image Playground, nuove opzioni AirPlay e una nuova interfaccia Siri scura.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6