aem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14970,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T12:00:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:05:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-espande-strumenti-scrittura-correttore-grammaticale-ios-27\",\"title\":\"Apple amplia gli strumenti di scrittura con un correttore grammaticale in iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"In iOS 27 Apple sta testando Writing Tools più avanzati, con riscrittura e generazione di testo, oltre a un correttore grammaticale dedicato simile a Grammarly.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/apple-intelligence-black-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-intelligence-black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14957,\"date\":\"2026-05-18T09:30:23+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:05:05+00:00\",\"slug\":\"suggested-genmoji-arrivo-ios-27\",\"title\":\"“Suggested Genmoji” in arrivo su iPhone con iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, Apple sta lavorando a iOS 27 per migliorare i Genmoji e introdurre “Suggested Genmoji”, idee emoji personalizzate basate su foto e frasi digitate spesso.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/macOS-Sequoia-Genmoji-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-Sequoia-Genmoji-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14877,\"date\":\"2026-05-14T20:30:51+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-14T15:51:04+00:00\",\"sl