era con controlli personalizzabili tramite widget, un nuovo pannello Meteo e una start page aggiornata per Safari.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14821,\"date\":\"2026-05-13T12:00:17+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-13T08:14:14+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-siri-riprogettata-interfaccia-chat-app-dedicata\",\"title\":\"iOS 27, Siri riprogettata con interfaccia chat e app dedicata\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, in iOS 27 Apple aggiorna Siri trasformandola in un chatbot/AI agent: Dynamic Island come hub, modalità conversazione e una nuova app dedicata.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Finder-Siri-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Finder-Siri-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14730,\"date\":\"2026-05-09T09:51:58+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-09T07:51:58+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-watch-series-12-watchos-27-cosa-aspettarsi\",\"title\":\"Apple Watch Series 12 e watchOS 27: cosa aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor su Touch ID, nuovi chip, nuove watch face e funzioni Apple Intelligence e satellite in watchOS 27, con lancio atteso a settembre.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-Touch-ID-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-Touch-ID\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14697,\"date\":\"2026-05-08T09:00:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-08T06:35:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-pro-fotocamere-ai-test-advanced-2\",\"title\":\"AirPods Pro con fotocamere AI: test “advanced” in corso\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, gli AirPods Pro con fotocamere integrate sono in fase di test “advanced”: design e feature set quasi definitivi, con possibile avvio della produzione iniziale.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/airpods-pro-3-orange-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-orange\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14695,\"date\":\"2026-05-08T08:35:12+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-08T06:35:12+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-wearable-tipo-airtag-fotocamere-integrazione-iphone\",\"title\":\"Apple lavora a un wearable “tipo AirTag” con fotocamere e integrazione iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman (Bloomberg), Apple continua lo sviluppo di un accessorio “pendant con fotocamere” e di smart glasses con integrazione iPhone.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Second-Generation-AirTag-Feature-Purple-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Second-Generation-AirTag-Feature-Purple\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/